flowchart Sounding the Channel

(Sight Land) -> [Heave the Lead] -> /Call the Depth/ -> <Six Fathoms?>
  -deep enough-> <Reef Ahead?>
    -clear-> (Drop Anchor)
    -breakers-> [Tack Away]
  -too shallow-> [Shorten Sail]
[Shorten Sail] -sound again-> [Heave the Lead]
[Tack Away] -sound again-> [Heave the Lead]
